WEBVTT

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:11.220
今天不要上班，咪养你。
No work today. I'll take care of you.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.480
啊对，今天休假。我忘关闹钟啦。
Oh, right. It's my day off. I forgot the alarm.

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:25.240
你：乖宝过来，先给我亲一口
You: Come here, baby, give me a kiss first.

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:28.520
咪只允许亲一下头。
Mii only allows a kiss on the head.

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:34.700
先抱一下，等会儿。现在，拖鞋。
One hug later. Now, slippers.

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:38.460
这只要朝这里。咪本来就知道。
This one faces here. Mii knew.

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:42.800
你：伸手摸摸咪的头夸它
You: Reach out and pat Mi's head, praising it

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:52.020
咪试了下果酱。用爪试的。
Mii tested the jam. With a paw.

00:00:52.420 --> 00:00:54.480
不是故意的。
Not on purpose.

00:00:57.860 --> 00:01:00.360
你：你怎么能偷吃呢！小猫不可以吃我的果酱
You: How could you sneak a bite! Kittens can't eat my jam

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:03.140
咪只是试了试。不是吃。
Mii only tested it. Not eating.

00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:07.990
咪会买一罐新的果酱。
Mii will buy a new jam.

00:01:08.390 --> 00:01:13.690
你乖乖休息。咪很快回来。
You rest. Mii will be back soon.

00:01:15.420 --> 00:01:17.920
你：你一个人出门？怎么买呀，有钱吗
You: You went out by yourself? How did you buy it? Do you even have money?

00:01:18.320 --> 00:01:20.070
咪有钱。咪才不小。
Mii has money. Mii is not small.

00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:29.220
就一罐。咪检查过了。
Just one jar. Mii checked.

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:35.480
你：夸咪会自己买东西
You: Praise Mi for shopping all by itself

00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:39.860
咪做到了。一个人。
Mii did it. Alone.

00:01:41.480 --> 00:01:43.280
酱粘住了。它好像特别舍不得这个锅。
The sauce stuck. It loves this pot.

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:47.420
第二回合。这次咪听话。
Round two. Mii listens this time.

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:53.040
你：没事，慢慢来，我想看你颠锅
You: It's okay, take your time. I want to watch you flip the pan

00:01:53.440 --> 00:01:55.070
第二回合。这次咪听话。
Round two. Mii listens this time.

00:01:59.040 --> 00:02:01.200
你看，它动了。
Look. It moved.

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:05.340
咪本来就知道。
Mii knew it would.

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:10.600
你：哇好厉害！快喂我尝一口
You: Wow, amazing! Quick, let me have a taste

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:14.340
咪早就知道会成功。
Mii knew it would work.

00:02:16.600 --> 00:02:18.620
小小一口。咪吹了两遍。
Tiny bite. Mii blew on it twice.

00:02:19.020 --> 00:02:20.580
味道如何？
How is it?

00:02:25.660 --> 00:02:28.160
你：说很好吃，摸摸咪的头
You: Say it's delicious and pat Mi's head

00:02:28.560 --> 00:02:30.770
咪早就知道会成功。
Mii knew it would work.

00:02:34.160 --> 00:02:38.430
就看一个。给咪的小脑袋放个假。
Just one video. Mii's brain needs a break.

00:02:38.830 --> 00:02:41.400
你看它的小短腿！
Look at its tiny legs!

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:45.720
你：你在看什么？给我也看看
You: What are you looking at? Let me see too

00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:47.970
咪：柯基视频。咪在学习。
Corgi video. Mii is studying.

00:02:51.720 --> 00:02:53.620
咪：好了，休息结束。
Okay. Break is over.

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:59.970
咪：玩一局吗？咪会一招。
One round? Mii knows one move.

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:03.280
你：你只会出石头吗？那我出布，包住你的爪爪
You: Can you only throw rock? Then I'll throw paper and wrap up your little paw

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:06.540
一招就够了。
One move is enough.

00:03:09.280 --> 00:03:12.140
布赢了。咪……本来就知道。
Paper wins. Mii... knew.

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:14.120
抱抱奖。咪准备好了。
Hug prize. Mii is ready.

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:20.840
你：伸手把咪抱进怀里
You: Reach out and pull Mi into your arms

00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:23.810
抱抱奖，咪收下了。
Hug prize... accepted.

00:03:26.840 --> 00:03:29.790
咪才不需要呢。……大部分时候。
Mii did not need it. Mostly.

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:32.450
等会儿还能摸摸头吗？
Can I get a head pat later?

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:38.400
你：今天辛苦啦，咪陪我坐着看晚霞好不好
You: Good work today. Will you sit with me and watch the sunset, Mi?

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:42.210
咪不累。基本上。
Mii is not tired. Mostly.

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:47.160
好吧。咪陪你坐着。
Okay. Mii will sit with you.

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:50.680
明天……还能这样吗？
Can we do this... again tomorrow?
